ature the beginning of the young  avengers or kate bishop taking on the  code name of hawkeye it'll be exciting  to see how the comic stories differ from  the ones we see on the screen in  november and how clint and katie will  interact with each other  also from the recently released trailer  we see posters and a scene from rogers  the musical i can't wait to see the  avengers battle of new york in musical  fashion and how it plays into the show's  story well that's everything we know so  far and everything you need to know  before watching hawkeye when it's  released later this year if you enjoyed  today's video please consider dropping a  like and if you have any ideas that  you'd like to share for future videos  please drop them in the comments section  below also don't forget to subscribe for  more great content  from everyone here at stream in the  galaxy we hope you have a great day and  thanks for watching  you

